STR(OnboardingWelcomeTitle, L"欢迎使用 DropShelf", L"Welcome to DropShelf")
STR(OnboardingWelcomeBody, L"一个随叫随到的临时置物架：把文件先放进来，换个窗口、换个文件夹，再从这里拖出去。", L"A temporary shelf that's there whenever you need it: put files on it, switch to another window or folder, then drag them back out.")
STR(OnboardingLookTitle, L"挑一种风格", L"Pick a style")
STR(OnboardingLookBody, L"简洁和 Windows 11 的设置一样清爽；纸牌把置物架做成一摞牌，牌面、牌背和牌桌都有。以后也可以在设置的外观页里换。", L"Simple looks like Windows 11 Settings; Cards turns the shelf into a deck with card faces, backs and a table. You can switch any time on the Appearance page in Settings.")
STR(OnboardingLookDone, L"就用这个", L"Use this")
STR(OnboardingShakeTitle, L"拖住文件，晃一晃", L"Drag a file and shake")
STR(OnboardingShakeBody, L"在资源管理器、桌面、浏览器或聊天软件里拖住文件，快速左右晃动鼠标，置物架就会出现在光标处。也可以拖到屏幕边缘停一下。", L"While dragging a file in File Explorer, on the desktop, in a browser or in a chat app, shake the mouse quickly left and right and a shelf appears at the cursor. You can also pause at the edge of the screen.")
STR(OnboardingStackTitle, L"放进来，再拖出去", L"Drop it in, drag it out")
STR(OnboardingStackBody, L"松开即可暂存。拖动缩略图堆叠可一次带走全部文件；点顶部的列表按钮展开列表后也能多选，只拖走需要的部分。拖出时默认移动文件，点左上角的“移动”可切换为复制。", L"Let go and the files stay on the shelf. Drag the thumbnail stack to take everything at once, or click the list button at the top to open the list and pick only the files you need. Files are moved when you drag them out; click Move at the top left to copy them instead.")
STR(OnboardingStackBodyCards, L"松开即可暂存。拖动缩略图堆叠可一次带走全部文件；点顶部的平铺按钮把牌摊开后也能多选，只拖走需要的部分。拖出时默认移动文件，点左上角的“移动”可切换为复制。", L"Let go and the files stay on the shelf. Drag the thumbnail stack to take everything at once, or click the spread button at the top to lay the cards out and pick only the files you need. Files are moved when you drag them out; click Move at the top left to copy them instead.")
STR(OnboardingActionsTitle, L"快速操作与快捷键", L"Quick actions and shortcut")
STR(OnboardingSampleFolder, L"文档", L"Documents")
STR(OnboardingSampleArchive, L"资料.zip", L"Files.zip")
STR(OnboardingWatchTitle, L"新文件，就在手边", L"New files, right at hand")
STR(OnboardingWatchBody, L"选一个文件夹（比如下载文件夹），里面出现新文件时，屏幕边缘会探出置物架的一角。点一下，置物架就带着这些文件伸出来。之后可以在“手势与置物架”设置里更改。", L"Pick a folder, such as Downloads. When a new file shows up there, the corner of a shelf peeks out from the edge of the screen. Click it and the shelf slides out with the new files. You can change this later under Gestures & shelf in Settings.")
STR(OnboardingSampleDownloads, L"下载", L"Downloads")
STR(OnboardingSampleFile, L"报告.pdf", L"Report.pdf")
